      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear you, but it feels like you're just saying what i want to hear so i feel better. it doesn't change the fact that everything is breaking. it feels like we're all just being forced to stay on a sinking ship and pretend we're enjoying the view. if the destination is inevitable, why does it matter if we fight it or just... let go? it feels way more peaceful to just stop caring about the outcome entirely.",
